  "job_B8.4.3.1_20251003_114835": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00feer ys mare, \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t gold \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t templ \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t gold gehalga\u00f0? & swa hwa swa swere\u00f0 on \u00feam weofode \u00fe\u00e6t ys naht, swa hwylc swa swere\u00fe on \u00fe\u00e6re offrunge \u00fee Eala ge blindan, hw\u00e6\u00feer ys mare \u00fee offrung \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t weofud \u00fee gehalga\u00f0 \u00fea offrunge? Witodlice se\u00fee swere\u00fe on weofude he swere\u00f0 on him & on eallum \u00feam \u00fee him ofer synt. & se \u00fee swere\u00f0 on temple he swere\u00f0 on him & on \u00feam \u00fee him on eardia\u00f0. & se\u00f0e swera\u00f0 on heofonan he swery\u00f0 on Godes \u00ferymsetle & on \u00feam \u00fee ofer \u00fe\u00e6t sitt. Wa eow boceras & Pharisei liccetteras, ge \u00fee teo\u00f0ia\u00f0 mintan & dile & cvmyn & ge forleton \u00fea \u00feing La blindan latteowas, ge drehnigea\u00f0 \u00feone gn\u00e6tt aweg & drinca\u00f0 \u00feone olfynd. Wa eow boceras & Pharisei, liccetteras, for\u00feam ge cl\u00e6nsia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t wi\u00f0utan ys caliceas & dixas, & ge Eala \u00feu blinda Phariseus, cl\u00e6nsa \u00e6ryst \u00fe\u00e6t wi\u00f0innan ys calicys & discys \u00fe\u00e6t hyt si cl\u00e6ne \u00fe\u00e6t Wa eow bocyras & Pharisei, liccetteras, for\u00feam ge synt gelice hwitum byrgenum \u00fea \u00feincea\u00f0 & swa ge \u00e6tywa\u00f0 mannum utan rihtwise, innan ge synt fulle liccettunge & unrihtwisnesse. Wa eow bocyras & Pharisei, liccetteras, ge \u00fee timbria\u00f0 witegena byrgene & glenga\u00f0 rihtwisra Witodlice ge synt e",
